          ],
          "returnType": "ReadonlyObservable<U>",
          "description": "A read-only value computed from this one by project, which must depend on its argument only. It subscribes to this value only while it has subscribers itself, and notifies only when the result differs from the last one it notified (Object.is), or when the result is a newly computed object, which may have been mutated in place. The result is computed lazily and reused while nothing it depends on changed, whether or not it has subscribers. Derived from writable Observables, each change computes every affected derived value at most once, also across chains and shared dependencies, and never from a mix of old and new values. Vectors, sizes and observables implemented outside the engine cannot report changes while unobserved: a value derived from one recomputes on every read."
        },
